      "cooked": "<p>Just got one at 41-18. &nbsp;Not as impressive as some of these others I’m seeing, but I had some cool title holders- Expatriette took Champion by sweeping through the inmates of the Block with an Aimed Submachine Gun, and Chrono-Ranger’s Whole Gang won him the title of Deathcaller. &nbsp;Wraith managed to take Seeker without even trying, and spread those debuffs like candy.</p>",
